  "handle": "napster-sofa-bed-indigo-blue",
  "description": "<p>Ever looked at your sofa and thought, “This should totally be a bed”? Same. That’s exactly why we created Napstera sofa cum bed that does more than just sit pretty. Designed for the way you live (and lounge), Napster is a shapeshifting sofabed that flips, folds, and flexes into 6 mood-matching comfort modes—from Netflix binges to nap marathons.\n<br>By day, it’s your stylish go-to for chilling, scrolling, or catching up over chai. By night, it transforms into a spacious queen-size bed (72 x 60 x 7.5 inches), perfect for you or your always-crashing friends. Whether you’re in Recharge Mode (lounger), Catch-Up Mode (upright seater), or full Crash Zone (flatbed), Napster has your back—literally.\n<br>Made with premium warp knit polyester fabric and firm high-density foam, it offers the perfect mix of support and snuggle. It’s low-maintenance, lightweight, easy to move, and crafted to last. No tools. No weird gaps. Just a smooth fold-out design that saves space and looks good doing it.\n<br>Available in two aesthetic-as-hell colours, Napster blends into your vibe without trying too hard. It’s the ultimate sofa cum bed for compact homes, cozy corners, and big chill energy.\n<br>So if you’re the napper, the host, or the \"\"5 more mins\"\" type—Napster is your new favourite place to be.\n<br>Sit. Lounge. Nap. Repeat.</p>",
